# Maintainer-only keys for update-provider-pricing.ts's live model coverage check.
# Copy to `.env` (in this same scripts/ directory) and fill in whichever keys you
# have — all four are optional and independent: a provider with no key here is
# just skipped for coverage-checking, with no error and no change to the
# scraper's normal behavior.
#
# This is deliberately separate from the workspace-root `.env` (server runtime
# config) and from the app's own encrypted credential vault, which is how
# end-user BYOK keys are actually stored and used at runtime. These keys are
# read ONLY by this maintenance script, ONLY to call each provider's own
# model-list endpoint and warn about any live model missing a scraped price —
# never to fetch pricing itself (no provider exposes that via API), and never
# read by the running server.
#
# Same variable names as each module's manifest.json requiredEnvVars, so an
# existing key value can be copied in directly without renaming.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
